From: Data-crea <sattler.daniel@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:31:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] OrionLayer Open Fix 56: the battle's events on the wire,
 numbered, drained into the next snapshot ("CMEV")

Ported onto orion2re v2.0.0 in scratch (work order 242 e) from local 5bd4c404:
renamed merge, others clean/ws-placed; cmbtmis.cpp three hunks by hand: v2 moved the merge loop into Merge_Missile (which returns after the merge), Kill_Missile gained slot-history clearing, the launch condition got a proton-torpedo speed term.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
